#: src/bare-metal/aps/better-uart.md
msgid "The PL011 actually has [more registers](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0183/g/programmers-model/summary-of-registers), and adding offsets to construct pointers to access them is error-prone and hard to read. Additionally, some of them are bit fields, which would be nice to access in a structured way."
