#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/exercise.md
msgid "`Vec::dedup_by_key<K: PartialEq>(&mut self /* &mut Vec<T> */, key: impl FnMut(&mut T) -> K)` (simplified)"
msgstr "`Vec::dedup_by_key<K: PartialEq>(&mut self /* &mut Vec<T> */, key: impl FnMut(&mut T) -> K)` (упрощённый)"

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/exercise.md
