msgstr "Посмотрите [документацию](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/primitive.pointer.html#method.as_mut) метода `as_mut`."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/safety-preconditions/determining.md
msgid "Highlight Safety section."
msgstr "Обратите внимание на раздел Safety."

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/safety-preconditions/determining.md
msgid "**Safety**"
msgstr "**Safety**"

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/safety-preconditions/determining.md
